  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - MY OH MY...
  - AS MUCH AS I \nLOVE WORKING ON \nPUZZLES...
  - IT CAN GET QUITE \nEXHAUSTING!
  - CASE IN POINT...
  - POLISHING THIS \nCANNON IS VERY \nBORING!!!
  - SAY,^05 IF YOU CAN \nBRING ME SOMETHING \nINTERESTING...
  - I MAY DO SOMETHING \nINTERESTING IN \nRETURN!
  - '* Like...?'
  - LIKE A FREE REWARD!
  - EVERYONE LOVES FREE \nREWARDS,^04 RIGHT?
  - WELL IT COULD BE \nYOURS FOR ONE \nIMPRESSED PAPYRUS!
  - THOUGH IT IS YOUR \nCHOICE.
  sounds:
  - snd_txtpap
  - snd_txtpap
  - snd_txtpap
